  "details": "Because Steam screenshots don't show you where the frame is, and because the built-in camera doesn't take stereoscopic shots, it's often more convenient to take a panoramic shot and then crop it down in an editor later.\n\nProblem is, when you take a panoramic shot, the player taking the shot doesn't appear in the shot. Many times, I'd like my hands to appear in the shot.",
